# Compiled provider binaries produced by `make build` / `make install`.
# The Makefile writes terraform-provider-secureworkload_<VERSION>_<OS>_<ARCH>
# into the repo root, which is easy to commit by accident.
terraform-provider-secureworkload_*
!terraform-provider-secureworkload_*.go
